.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct libnvme_mem_huge" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct libnvme_mem_huge \- Huge page memory allocation descriptor
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct libnvme_mem_huge {
.br
.BI "    size_t len;"
.br
.BI "    bool libnvme_alloc;"
.br
.BI "    void *p;"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "len" 12
Size of the allocated buffer in bytes
.IP "libnvme_alloc" 12
Indicates that \fIp\fP was allocated using \fBlibnvme_alloc\fP
.IP "p" 12
Pointer to the allocated memory buffer
.SH "Description"
Describes a memory buffer allocated by \fBlibnvme_alloc_huge\fP. The structure
stores allocation metadata required for proper cleanup by
\fBlibnvme_free_huge\fP.
